<title>USA: University of Mo. $95 mln notes won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>University of Mo. $95 mln notes won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said Tuesday it won $95 million University of Missouri capital project notes at a true interest cost of 3.793272 percent.</p>
<p>The notes carry a 4.25 percent coupon and mature on June 30, 1998.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
